0..76 Comment "// A relation a call returns splits as one a parameter holds. A `run` binder"
77..152 Comment "// is written with no type, so a match on it takes the record\'s layout from"
153..225 Comment "// the result the called function was written with: the four fields of a"
226..304 Comment "// quasi-inverse, and the two inverses of an equivalence, each a record of its"
305..312 Comment "// own."
